<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China Travel shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China Travel shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd was suspended at the company's request, pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The shares closed unchanged at HK$4.125 on Thursday.</p>
<p>China Travel is a unit of mainland tourism conglomerate China Travel Service. -- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6369</p>
